{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"tv/31654","tmdb_id":31654,"title":"数码宝贝","original_title":"デジモンアドベンチャー","overview":"1999年，由于数码世界资料异常增生，导致数码世界和现实世界的连接发生紊乱。地球上相应地出现奇怪的自然现象：东南亚没有下雨，池塘全部干涸；中东却因为连场大雨发生洪水；美国则遇到有史以来最寒冷的冬天。11岁的少年八神太一（藤田淑子 配音），和伙伴石田大和（风间勇刀 配音）、武之内空（水谷优子 配音）、泉光子郎（天神有海 配音）、太刀川美美（前田爱 配音）、城户丈（菊池正美 配音）、高石武（小西寛子 配音）一起参加了夏令营，一次意外却被神秘地送到了一个多彩的数码世界。在那里，他们得到了叫做“数码宝贝”的搭档。进入数码世界后，八神太一一行人遇到了凶恶的怪兽贝壳兽，眼看大家都要被抓住的时候，太一的亚古兽忽然进化成为暴龙兽，拯救了他们。进化到底是怎么回事情？数码世界究竟是什么？无数的谜团出现在被召选的小朋友们面前，精彩的冒险就这样开始了……","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6RuSTSBGvFYMjBxSpxmQ56kBicn.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/naP3oYVX0vSxpx0HjUkdeKbkfiA.jpg","first_air_date":"1999-03-07","last_air_date":"2001-03-25","year":"1999","episode_run_time":"22 minutes","number_of_episodes":104,"number_of_seasons":2,"tmdb_rating_average":8.1,"tmdb_votes":939,"tmdb_rating":"8.1 / 10 from 939 users","genres":["动画","动作冒险","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"languages":["Japanese"],"countries":["Japan"],"production_companies":["Toei Animation","Toei Company"],"directors":[],"producers":[],"cast":[{"id":81862,"name":"木内玲子","original_name":"木内レイコ","character":"Daisuke Motomiya (voice)","image":""},{"id":1244242,"name":"浦和惠","original_name":"浦和めぐみ","character":"Iori Hida / Armadimon (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/d02D5dxz8bmAuIkG8GrUabKvBW7.jpg"},{"id":1241842,"name":"夏树莉绪","original_name":"夏樹リオ","character":"Miyako Inoue (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/46BlB9cVS0Qq0XnG0lhqbbdbZna.jpg"},{"id":84505,"name":"平田广明","original_name":"平田広明","character":"Takeru Takaishi (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/mMWEdlssJm3TVuXW4Wb7pQeX20Z.jpg"},{"id":81243,"name":"朴璐美","original_name":"朴璐美","character":"Ken Ichijouji / Digimon Kaiser (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/fl9vyA3HEkOyTiZBJBhAR3OSmrO.jpg"},{"id":216449,"name":"野田顺子","original_name":"野田順子","character":"V-mon (voice)","